  "researchNotes": "Read the official Shopify feed (products.json, 84 listings; body_html is empty) and then each perfume product page, where notes (head/heart/base), the perfumer byline and the collection (Eau de Parfum, Extrait Extrême, Eau Intimité) are shown. 40 fragrances kept. Excluded: discovery sets, MTO bundles, coffee (Extrait de Café), sachets, incense, fragrance tags, hand cream and 350ml body products, merch, gift wrapping, and the Korean-language duplicate listing of Drunk Lovers 50ml. Drunk Lovers exists as two different products (Eau de Parfum and Extrait Extrême) and is kept as two entries. Collection pages state strength only as a percentage band (Eau de Parfum 30-40%, Extrait Extrême 55-62%) with no hours of longevity, so no performance data was added. Brand country is not stated (product pages only say made in Korea), so country is null; no Italian distributor found on the official site (stockist page checked). Perfumer names are taken from the page bylines (spelling normalised to accents/capitals; the shop itself varies the spelling of Margaux Le Paih-Guérin) and may carry the shop's own spelling; one stray 'Absolute' list item on Cuvée Skin was dropped.",
